  "description": "A cute herbalist meets five warriors.\n\nA hybrid: half animal, half human. Kakana, the hybrid herbalist-in-hiding awakes to find five poisoned and lost adventurers who ask for her help. In a world where non-hybrids want the extinction of her kind, she must decide whether to take on the adventure to save them or to continue to stay hidden.\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes two side story chapters.*",
